# Docker build context trimming for the buggies server image.
#
# NOTE: the buggies image is built with the PARENT (kernel/) directory as the
# context (see Dockerfile), and Docker only reads .dockerignore from the
# context root. So for the real build these patterns belong at the kernel root
# as `kernel/.dockerignore` — copy or symlink this file there. Kept here too so
# the patterns live with the module and apply if buggies/ is ever built as its
# own context. Paths are written relative to the buggies module.

# Build output / binaries
bin/
dist/
*.test
*.out

# Dev-only multi-module workspace (the image sets GOWORK=off anyway)
go.work
go.work.sum

# Node deps are never needed in the image. web/dist (the built dashboard) is
# served from BUGGIES_WEB_DIR at runtime, not baked in — mount it if you enable
# the admin dashboard in the container.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/

# Local state and secrets — never bake these into an image layer
.env
*.pem
*.key
*.db
.buggies-store.key

# VCS and editor noise
.git/
.gitignore
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Docs don't affect the build
*.md
